new occurrences created by subsequent rewrites\n   - `remember X as b eqn:H`: replaces ALL occurrences of X in proof state with b (uses definitional equality)\n   - `rewrite H in *`: rewrites in all hypotheses but may silently skip some; `rewrite H in Hyp` is more explicit\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **BVList.v** (primary): Four helper lemmas + `bvor_slt_key` added before `End RAWBITVECTOR_LIST.` (around lines 15594-15870)\n\n     Helper lemmas (lines ~15594-15637):\n     ```coq\n     Lemma last_false_list2int_ub : forall v, v <> [] -> last v false = false ->\n       (list2int v < pow2_int (length v - 1))%Z.\n\n     Lemma last_map_negb : forall v, v <> [] ->\n       last (map negb v) false = negb (last v false).\n\n     Lemma last_map2_orb_eq : forall a b, length a = length b -> a <> [] ->\n       last (map2 orb a b) false = orb (last a false) (last b false).\n     ```\n\n     Key structural elements of `bvor_slt_key` (lines ~15638-15870):\n     ```coq\n     Lemma bvor_slt_key : forall (n : N) (s t x : bitvector),\n       size s = n -> size t = n -> size x = n ->\n       bv_slt (bv_or x s) t = true ->\n       bv_slt (bv_or (bv_not (bv_subt s t)) s) t = true.\n     ```\n     Key steps in the proof:\n     - `n = 0` handled by `destruct s as [| h_s tl_s]` nil case\n     - `set (s := h_s :: tl_s) in *`\n     - `assert Hs_ne, Hs_len_pos, HLen_st, HLen_Ds`\n     - `pose proof (@list2int_subst_list_formula s t HLen_st) as HDform`\n     - `rewrite bv_slt_iff_sbv2int in Hslt` + goal\n     - `unfold sbv2int in *`\n     - `set T S D V Vs Vand Xs P`; `unfold bv2int in *; fold T S D V Vs Vand Xs P`\n     - `rewrite HVs_unfold, HXs_unfold in *`\n     - Various arithmetic lemmas: `HVD_sum`, `HIE`, `HVand_le_S`, `HXs_ge_S`\n     - Non-emptiness assertions with `simpl in H` before `lia`\n     - `destruct (bv_ult s t)` main case split\n     - Inside `bv_ult s t = true` branch: `HD_val`, `HV_val`, `HVs_val`, `HVs_lt_T`\n     - Nested `destruct (last ...) eqn:HVs_sign; destruc