{"type":"file-history-snapshot","messageId":"914cd0bf-e38f-41c8-b8e1-79c6d70416b5","snapshot":{"messageId":"914cd0bf-e38f-41c8-b8e1-79c6d70416b5","trackedFileBackups":{"BVList.v":{"backupFileName":"126828487f172d5a@v3","version":3,"backupTime":"2026-06-05T18:32:34.450Z"},"CLAUDE.md":{"backupFileName":"67f5f64815a3bd03@v12","version":12,"backupTime":"2026-06-05T18:32:34.442Z"}},"timestamp":"2026-06-05T18:36:02.067Z"},"isSnapshotUpdate":false}
{"parentUuid":"914cd0bf-e38f-41c8-b8e1-79c6d70416b5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01WXcz1DiPq9LA9bRtEwMKsY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I can't know for certain, but the most likely causes:\n\n1. **Manual `rm -rf ~/.claude`** — if you ever cleared your Claude config/cache to fix an issue, the whole projects folder goes with it.\n\n2. **Claude Code update or reinstall** — some versions or reinstall methods wiped the projects directory in the past.\n\n3. **The project was never created there** — if you always ran `claude` from `/home/hakull245/bitvector-vibe-proving/` even when working on vibe-proving content, all logs would have been written to the bitvector project folder, not a separate vibe-proving one.\n\n4. **OS/WSL issue** — you're on WSL2, and WSL can occasionally lose files in the Linux filesystem if Windows forcibly terminates the WSL process or if there's a disk issue.\n\nThe third option is actually worth checking — do you remember if you ever ran `claude` from inside `~/vibe-proving/` specifically, or might those sessions have happened from a different directory?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":172,"cache_read_input_tokens":94429,"output_tokens":238,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":172,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":3,"output_tokens":238,"cache_read_input_tokens":94429,"cache_creation_input_tokens":172,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":172},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CbkbY8c8GqNDTjLj8Qkvj","type":"assistant","uuid":"e40bf7cf-aac2-4e29-a4ab-4b5e6ffc804f","timestamp":"2026-06-05T18:36:09.187Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":